<messaging:emailTemplate subject="On Hold Clarification Required – Check New Proof (PO# {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}/Order #{!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}) {!relatedTo.ThreadID_FK__c}" 
recipientType="Contact"  relatedToType="case">

    <messaging:htmlEmailBody >

<html>

<style>
body {font-family: 'source sans pro';}
</style>


<p align="center" style="text-align:left"><b>Thank you for ordering from Anchor Wallace. Your order is temporarily on hold.</b><br/></p>

 <p align="center" style="text-align:left">The issues below need resolved before your order can move into production.</p>
    
    <p><b>PO Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_PO_Number__c}<br/>
    <b>Order Number:</b> {!relatedTo.EBS_Order_ID__c}<br/> </p>
    <p><b>Please click the link below to view your proof.</b> If you are having issues opening the link, try to copy/paste it into your browser.</p><br/>
     
    
    


Be sure to carefully review the proof for the following:<br/>

<ul><li>Typographical Errors</li>
     <li>Valid Color Separation</li>
    <li>Correct Imprint Position and Size</li>
    <li>Correct Imprinting Colors</li>
    <li>Missing Type/Copy/Logos</li>
    <li>Correct Layout</li>
</ul>  


<p>Issues: <br/>
<br/><c:clarQuestions rcaseID="{!relatedTo}"/>
<br/>
</p>

______________________________________________________________________<br/>




<p>The Anchor Wallace Customer Care Team<br/>
<a href = "mailto:anchorwallace@anchorwallace.com">anchorwallace@anchorwallace.com</a><br/>
1-800-533-3570 Option 3<br/><br/></p>


</html>
    </messaging:htmlEmailBody>

</messaging:emailTemplate>